# Antifragility as ratchet

When a failure class appears (guessed status, missing freeze file, invented ID, GitLab habit, silent skip), add a tighter guide or sensor. Keep existing guards.

Do not delete a check to make CI green. Do not claim this repository or harness is antifragile.

MVP remains the reconstructed SRS. Extra scope goes to Future, not into the first restaurant cut.
